msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「You're late! Where have you been＿wandering around all this time?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Llegas tarde! ¿Por dónde has estado＿dando vueltas todo este tiempo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not even dark yet. What, did you＿need me for something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ni siquiera ha oscurecido aún.＿¿Qué, necesitabas algo de mí?」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm here for dinner, obviously. You can＿cook again, right?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Vine a cenar, obviamente. Ya puedes＿cocinar de nuevo, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, that's right, I should get dinner＿started...... What shall we have?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, es cierto, debería empezar a＿preparar la cena...... ¿Qué comemos?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Since it's New Year's Eve, soba＿noodles?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Como es Nochevieja, ¿fideos soba?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Following tradition, huh...... We should＿have the ingredients. Alright, let's go＿with that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Siguiendo la tradición, eh......＿Deberíamos tener los ingredientes.＿Bien, hagamos eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（The other ingredients...... Oh, nameko＿mushrooms and radishes. We'll have＿mushroom soba!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Los demás ingredientes......＿Ah, hongos nameko y rábanos. ¡Cenaremos＿soba de hongos!）」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuujiii～ I want tempura soba. And＿fried prawns on top!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuujiii～! Quiero soba con tempura.＿¡Y camarones fritos encima!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This isn't a restaurant. We're having＿mushroom soba tonight.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Esto no es un restaurante. Hoy＿cenaremos soba de hongos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Whaaaat～～?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Quéééé～～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If you have a problem with that, feel＿free not to eat it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si tienes algún problema con eso,＿eres libre de no comerlo.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'll eat it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Me lo comeré!」"

msgid "Taiga「......But it would be way better if there＿was tempura on top.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Pero estaría mucho mejor＿si tuviera tempura encima.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Drop it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Déjalo ya.」"

msgid "Host「Now, let's introduce the super-popular＿idol group, Thunder!」"
msgstr "Presentador「¡Y ahora, les presentamos al＿superpopular grupo idol, Thunder!」"

msgid "Taiga「Ugh. I hate them.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Agh. Los odio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey now, don't change the channel.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, no cambies de canal.」"

msgid "Reporter「Good evening～! This New Year's Eve I＿have arrived at the bustling bridge＿shrine～!」"
msgstr "Reportero「¡Buenas noches～! ¡Esta Nochevieja＿he llegado al concurrido santuario＿del puente～!」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, look! The shrine on TV, it's the one＿right up the street!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Oh, mira! ¡El santuario de la tele＿es el que está subiendo la calle!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now that you mention it, it does look＿familiar.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora que lo mencionas, sí＿que me resulta familiar.」"

msgid "Reporter「Patrons have gathered one after＿another to celebrate Hatsumode～＿Everyone's in the New Year's spirit～!」"
msgstr "Reportero「¡Los visitantes se reúnen uno tras otro＿para celebrar el Hatsumode～ Todos tienen＿el espíritu de Año Nuevo～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Looks pretty crowded.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Parece que hay mucha gente.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hatsumode, huh......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Hatsumode, eh......」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey, if you went to celebrate＿Hatsumode, what would you wish for?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, si fueras a celebrar el＿Hatsumode, ¿qué pedirías?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'd wish for all of my memories to＿return, of course.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pediría que volvieran todos mis＿recuerdos, por supuesto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Of course you would. That was a silly＿thing to ask.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Claro que sí. Qué pregunta＿más tonta hice.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What about you? What would you wish＿for?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y tú? ¿Qué es lo que pedirías?」"

msgid "Taiga「Nothing, really.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Nada, en realidad.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What? Don't wanna tell me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? ¿No quieres decírmelo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Then try and guess. If you're right, I'll＿tell you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entonces intenta adivinar.＿Si aciertas, te lo digo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（\"Try and guess,\" she says...... What＿would Taiga wish for?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（\"Intenta adivinar\", dice......＿¿Qué pediría Taiga?）」"

msgid "Can't think of anything"
msgstr "No se me ocurre nada"

msgid "For bigger breasts"
msgstr "Tener pechos más grandes"

msgid "Not to be clumsy"
msgstr "No ser torpe"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not to be clumsy?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No ser torpe?」"

msgid "Taiga「Excuse you!? Why would I wish for＿that?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Cómo dices?! ¡¿Por qué pediría eso?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It just sprang to mind. I remembered＿one of your clumsy-girl moments.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Simplemente se me vino a la mente.＿Recordé una de tus torpezas.」"

msgid "Taiga「Which one?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Cuál?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「One time, you spilled strawberry milk＿all over the inside of your locker at＿school, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Una vez derramaste leche de fresa＿por todo el interior de tu casillero＿en la escuela, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In that locker, a horrific milk-covered＿scene...... Mm, it was like a haven of＿gross, really.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En ese casillero, una escena terrible＿cubierta de leche...... Mmm, era como＿un paraíso del asco, la verdad.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yep yep. As thanks, you gave me a＿premium-brand towel. It was so soft on＿my skin......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, sí. Como agradecimiento, me diste＿una toalla de marca fina. Era tan＿suave en mi piel......」"

msgid "Taiga「Quit grinning...... Sheesh, don't＿remember such pointless stuff.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Deja de sonreír así...... Cielos,＿no recuerdes cosas tan inútiles.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, so that really did happen.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, así que eso sí pasó de verdad.」"

msgid "Taiga「That DID happen, but that isn't what＿I'd wish for.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso SÍ pasó, pero no es＿lo que yo pediría.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then what would you wish for?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces, ¿qué pedirías?」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm not telling unless you guess it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No te lo diré a menos que adivines.」"

msgid "Taiga「......But you managed to remember＿something, so as a reward, I'll take you＿to the shrine.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Pero lograste recordar＿algo, así que como premio, te＿llevaré al santuario.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why is a national holiday my reward?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué mi premio es un día festivo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Weren't you going to make your wish?＿For all your memories to return?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No ibas a pedir tu deseo? ¿Que＿regresaran todos tus recuerdos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Guess there's no harm in doing it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo que no hace daño intentarlo.」"

msgid "Taiga「So, like I said, I'll take you to celebrate＿Hatsumode.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así que, como dije, te llevaré＿a celebrar el Hatsumode.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I bet you just want to go, huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Apuesto a que solo quieres ir, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up! Are you going or not?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¿Vas a ir o no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Bingo.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bingo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up! Die! Go to hell!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡Muérete! ¡Vete al infierno!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'll go, I'm going, so please take me with＿you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Voy, voy, así que por favor＿llévame contigo.」"

msgid "Taiga「You should've said that from the start.＿Quick, finish your food and let's go.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Debiste decir eso desde el principio.＿Rápido, termina de comer y vámonos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No idea. Nothing's coming to mind.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ni idea. No se me ocurre nada.」"

msgid "Taiga「What a boring mongrel～ The point of＿guessing is to GUESS, you know?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Qué perro tan aburrido～ La gracia＿de adivinar es ADIVINAR, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I can't even guess my own guess. So,＿what was the answer?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ni siquiera puedo hacer una suposición.＿Entonces, ¿cuál era la respuesta?」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm not telling someone who won't even＿try to guess.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No se lo digo a alguien que ni＿siquiera intenta adivinar.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Thanks for the food. I'm going home.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Gracias por la comida. Me voy.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Going home already?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ya te vas a casa?」"

msgid "Taiga「I only came for the food, so obviously＿I'd go home now that I'm full. Happy＿New Year, see ya.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Solo vine por la comida, así que es＿obvio que me voy ahora que estoy llena.＿Feliz Año Nuevo, nos vemos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh, you too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah, igualmente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I should take it easy on a day like＿this...... Since Yasuko's out, I guess I'm＿spending New Year's with Inko-chan......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Debería tomármelo con calma un día como＿hoy...... Como Yasuko salió, pasaré Año＿Nuevo con Inko-chan......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「For bigger breasts?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tener pechos más grandes?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Excuse me? W-W-What?! What did＿you say!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Cómo dices? ¡¿Q-Q-Qué?!＿¡¿Qué dijiste?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Aargh!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Aaagh!」"

msgid "Taiga「Why would I wish for THAT?! Are you＿STUPID!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Por qué pediría ESO?!＿¡¿Eres ESTÚPIDO?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga...... Don't punch me in the face......＿Thought my nose was broken for a＿moment there......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga...... No me des en la cara......＿Por un momento pensé que me habías＿roto la nariz......」"

msgid "Taiga「Be quiet, Satan!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate, Satanás!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But...... You had me put chest pads in＿your swimsuit, right? So in other＿words......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero...... Me hiciste poner relleno＿en tu traje de baño, ¿no? Así que,＿en otras palabras......」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't bring that back up!　For god's＿sake, is your skull clogged up with＿filth!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No vuelvas a sacar eso! Por el＿amor de Dios, ¡¿tienes la cabeza＿llena de porquería?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón.」"

msgid "Taiga「Thanks for the food.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Gracias por la comida.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're done already? But there's still＿dessert.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ya terminaste? Pero todavía＿queda postre.」"

msgid "Taiga「I've had enough.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya comí suficiente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you upset?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Estás molesta?」"

msgid "Taiga「Whatever!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Como sea!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, I'm really sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, lo siento de verdad.」"

msgid "Taiga「Leave me alone! Happy New Year, see＿ya!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Déjame en paz! ¡Feliz＿Año Nuevo, nos vemos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What was that about? She WAS＿upset......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y eso a qué vino? Sí que＿ESTABA molesta......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Since Yasuko's out, I guess I'm＿spending New Year's with Inko-chan......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Como Yasuko salió, supongo que pasaré＿Año Nuevo con Inko-chan......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'd like to make it from scratch for this＿occasion, but I guess I'll have to＿compromise with premade broth......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Me gustaría hacerlo desde cero esta＿vez, pero tendré que conformarme＿con caldo preparado......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Taiga's not the most patient.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Taiga no tiene mucha paciencia.）」"
